# the retire floor -- graded both ways by test/check_suite_shape.sh against test/asm's
# own file list, the same rule nano/asm/OBSERVED_FLOOR states for nano's own suite. A
# floor is a minimum: a retire count may rise and stay green. A program nano's core
# cannot run at all -- it needs a CSR (Zicsr, Zifencei's fence.i included, since nano has
